# Committed reference frames and generated assets are binary. Force git to
# treat them as binary so it never applies line-ending conversion (LF -> CRLF)
# on checkout, which would corrupt a PPM whose header happens to contain no NUL
# byte and shift the raster by one byte on Windows.
tests/golden/*.ppm binary
assets/primitives/*.wsmesh binary
assets/primitives/*.wstex binary
